src/grammar.json of https://github.com/6cdh/tree-sitter-scheme.git
(commit 45c72463ac4260ef6e07d1c0642ed43d4e9957b4), with its LICENSE.
tags.scm is written for TeXmacs.
highlights.scm is written for TeXmacs after queries/highlights.scm of the same
commit (MIT, see LICENSE).
indents.scm is generated from the indentation of progs/tm-mode.el of TeXmacs.
In the grammar, for the Scheme of TeXmacs (S7, Guile): the hexadecimal escapes
of strings need no final semicolon (\x10), and | is a character of symbols (no
|...| symbols of R7RS).
Symbols may start with digits followed by a letter other than e (2d-list,
as in TeXmacs; 1e5 stays a number).
